nixpkgs: nixos-26.05 (see flake.lock)
changes: First version of series 0.1. (1) Generic base: new bnox.users option (per-user SSH keys, wheel, home-manager dotfiles); the hardcoded user, key binding, and personal timezone are gone (0/0/1 bootstrap exception made permanent here). Hosts MUST declare bnox.users or their own users or they have no SSH access. (2) Deployment pipeline is arch-aware: image builds use the host platform (was hardcoded x86_64-linux). (3) Webhook vhost is configurable: bnox.deployment.webhook.address (default http://bnox-webhook.local). (4) Dead code dropped: bnox.lib.mkEnvFile. (5) Per-thing git branch: bnox.things.<name>.branch (default main; .bnox/thing.nix may declare it, host may override). (6) minimal profile defensively disables xserver.
